==English==
[[File:Parus caeruleus1.jpg|thumb|a '''blue tit''']]

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Flame, not lame-blue tit.wav|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[blue]] {{l|en|tit|id=bird}}}}

# A bird of species {{taxfmt|Cyanistes caeruleus|species}} of [[tit]]s in family {{taxfmt|Paridae|family}}, with an azure blue crown and dark blue line passing through the eye and encircling the white cheeks to the chin.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|blue titmouse}}, {{vern|Eurasian blue tit}}, {{l|en|pickcheese}}

